{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"rift_colossus","model_identifier":"rift_colossus","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# rift_colossus\n\nRift colossus (C3), breaker, 6 m = 213 u to the top of the shoulder crags (head top 202 u).\n\nBuilt like a mountain: violet-grey stone body with darker stone limbs, stone plates over the chest and belt, huge shoulder crags and a back crag, a head sunk forward under a brow plate with violet eyes, great stony fists, and a crack of white-violet light running down the front of its whole body (head, chest, hips, shins and forearms; glow_crack_*), widening to a glowing core in the chest (`fx_beam`). Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (scaled).\n\n- Cubes: 36 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 512x512, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -92.0..92.0, y 0.0..213.0, z -43.0..36.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 150 x 205 x 80 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -4, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 5 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 2.8 | loop |  |\n| `attack_smash` | 2.6 | once | key 1.4 s: both fists smash down in front (also its wall attack) |\n| `ground_slam` | 3 | once | key 1.6 s: both fists driven into the ground, drops to one knee (area hit around it, radius ~3 m) |\n| `void_beam` | 2 | loop | held beam from fx_beam (chest crack) toward the target (loop while held) |\n| `aggro` | 2.6 | once | rears up and pounds the air |\n| `injured` | 0.9 | once | heavy flinch |\n| `death` | 3 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), cycle 2.8 s, 99.6 u per cycle (it never runs)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_smash`: key 1.4 s: both fists smash down in front (also its wall attack)\n- `ground_slam`: key 1.6 s: both fists driven into the ground, drops to one knee (area hit around it, radius ~3 m)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 202, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 142, 29.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (22, 158.5, 29.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (37.5, 177.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 133.5, -29.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (66, 61, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-82.5, 103, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-66, 61, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (33, 93, 19.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-33, 93, 19.5)\n- `fx_beam` on `torso` at (0, 142, -33)\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l, glow_crack_* and glow_core are the lit cubes.\n- No `run`: a 6 m colossus only walks (walk doubles as its move).\n"},"description":"# rift_colossus\n\nRift colossus (C3), breaker, 6 m = 213 u to the top of the shoulder crags (head top 202 u).\n\nBuilt like a mountain: violet-grey stone body with darker stone limbs, stone plates over the chest and belt, huge shoulder crags and a back crag, a head sunk forward under a brow plate with violet eyes, great stony fists, and a crack of white-violet light running down the front of its whole body (head, chest, hips, shins and forearms; glow_crack_*), widening to a glowing core in the chest (`fx_beam`). Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (scaled).\n\n- Cubes: 36 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 512x512, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -92.0..92.0, y 0.0..213.0, z -43.0..36.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 150 x 205 x 80 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -4, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 5 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 2.8 | loop |  |\n| `attack_smash` | 2.6 | once | key 1.4 s: both fists smash down in front (also its wall attack) |\n| `ground_slam` | 3 | once | key 1.6 s: both fists driven into the ground, drops to one knee (area hit around it, radius ~3 m) |\n| `void_beam` | 2 | loop | held beam from fx_beam (chest crack) toward the target (loop while held) |\n| `aggro` | 2.6 | once | rears up and pounds the air |\n| `injured` | 0.9 | once | heavy flinch |\n| `death` | 3 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), cycle 2.8 s, 99.6 u per cycle (it never runs)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_smash`: key 1.4 s: both fists smash down in front (also its wall attack)\n- `ground_slam`: key 1.6 s: both fists driven into the ground, drops to one knee (area hit around it, radius ~3 m)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 202, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 142, 29.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (22, 158.5, 29.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (37.5, 177.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 133.5, -29.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (66, 61, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-82.5, 103, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-66, 61, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (33, 93, 19.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-33, 93, 19.5)\n- `fx_beam` on `torso` at (0, 142, -33)\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l, glow_crack_* and glow_core are the lit cubes.\n- No `run`: a 6 m colossus only walks (walk doubles as its move).\n","resolution":{"width":512,"height":1024},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-32.0,90.0,-20.0],"to":[32.0,104.0,20.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,90.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,485,64.0,499.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[128,485,168.0,499.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[64,485,128.0,499.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[168,485,208.0,499.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[440,323,504.0,363.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,367,64.0,407.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid